    // 交互式实验室：每个演示的说明和“模型说明与局限”
    demos: {
      enaqt: {
        intro: T('FMO 复合物七个色素的激子模型：激发从位点 1（或 6，靠近天线的一侧）出发，在位点 3 被反应中心以速率 κ 取走，同时以速率 Γ 在每个位点上损失。改变纯退相干率 γ，看传递效率怎样变化。',
          'An exciton model of the seven pigments of the FMO complex: the excitation starts on site 1 (or 6, on the antenna side), is taken away from site 3 by the reaction centre at rate κ, and is lost on every site at rate Γ. Change the pure dephasing rate γ and watch how the transfer efficiency responds.'),
        notes: T('哈密顿量取 Adolphs 与 Renger（2006）的站点能量与耦合（单位 cm⁻¹，经 2πc 换算成 rad/ps）。退相干用 Haken–Strobl 模型：每个位点上的独立纯退相干，等效于无限高温的无记忆环境，所以不会趋向热平衡，也不包含振动–电子耦合。效率 η = κ∫ρ₃₃dt 由 ∫₀^∞e^{𝓛t}dt = −𝓛⁻¹ 解 49 元复线性方程精确得到，与时间积分的结果一致（tools/quantum-bio-test.mjs 核对）。这是 Mohseni 等人（2008）、Rebentrost 等人（2009）研究过的模型的简化版，效率的具体数值取决于 κ、Γ 的取法，演示的是趋势：完全相干和过强退相干都不如适度退相干。更真实的模拟需要 HEOM 等方法（第 07 节）。',
          'The Hamiltonian uses the site energies and couplings of Adolphs and Renger (2006) (in cm⁻¹, converted to rad/ps with 2πc). Dephasing follows the Haken–Strobl model: independent pure dephasing on each site, equivalent to a memoryless environment at infinite temperature, so the model does not relax to thermal equilibrium and has no vibronic coupling. The efficiency η = κ∫ρ₃₃dt is obtained exactly from ∫₀^∞e^{𝓛t}dt = −𝓛⁻¹ by solving a 49-unknown complex linear system, and agrees with time integration (checked in tools/quantum-bio-test.mjs). This is a simplified version of the model studied by Mohseni et al. (2008) and Rebentrost et al. (2009); the exact efficiencies depend on the choice of κ and Γ, and what the demo shows is the trend: both fully coherent transport and excessive dephasing do worse than moderate dephasing. More realistic simulations need methods such as HEOM (section 07).'),
      },
      compass: {
        intro: T('一个自由基对：电子 1 与一个自旋 1/2 的核有各向异性的超精细耦合，电子 2 没有。自由基对以单重态生成，以速率 k 反应。改变地磁场与分子轴的夹角，看单重态产率怎样随方向变化：这条曲线就是“化学罗盘”的读数。',
          'One radical pair: electron 1 has an anisotropic hyperfine coupling to a spin-½ nucleus, electron 2 has none. The pair is born singlet and reacts at rate k. Change the angle between the Earth\'s field and the molecular axis and watch how the singlet yield depends on direction: this curve is the reading of a "chemical compass".'),
        notes: T('8 维自旋空间（两个电子、一个核），磁场在 xz 平面内，超精细张量为对角 A = diag(A⊥, A⊥, A∥)，单位 mT；γ_e = 1.761 × 10¹¹ rad s⁻¹ T⁻¹。哈密顿量在这个基下是实对称矩阵，用 Jacobi 方法求本征分解，再按 Timmel 等人（1998）的公式求产率；结果与直接时间积分一致。模型假设单重态和三重态以同一速率复合，没有自旋弛豫、电子间的交换和偶极耦合。真实的 FAD–色氨酸自由基对有十几个磁性核，各向异性会部分相互抵消。自旋弛豫会降低方向灵敏度，这里没有包括。',
          'An 8-dimensional spin space (two electrons, one nucleus), with the field in the xz plane and a diagonal hyperfine tensor A = diag(A⊥, A⊥, A∥) in mT; γ_e = 1.761 × 10¹¹ rad s⁻¹ T⁻¹. In this basis the Hamiltonian is a real symmetric matrix, diagonalized with the Jacobi method; the yield then follows from the formula of Timmel et al. (1998) and agrees with direct time integration. The model assumes singlet and triplet recombine at the same rate, and has no spin relaxation and no exchange or dipolar coupling between the electrons. A real FAD–tryptophan pair has a dozen or more magnetic nuclei whose anisotropies partly cancel. Spin relaxation would reduce the directional sensitivity and is not included here.'),
      },
      kie: {
        intro: T('一个 C–H 键上的氢转移：反应物的 C–H 伸缩零点能在过渡态消失，势垒顶部用抛物线近似，虚频 ν‡ 决定势垒的宽窄。比较氢和氘的速率，看隧穿怎样改变同位素效应和 Arrhenius 参数。',
          'Hydrogen transfer from a C–H bond: the zero-point energy of the reactant C–H stretch is lost at the transition state, the barrier top is approximated by a parabola, and the imaginary frequency ν‡ sets how narrow the barrier is. Compare the rates for hydrogen and deuterium and watch how tunnelling changes the isotope effect and the Arrhenius parameters.'),
        notes: T('一维 Bell 模型：穿透概率取抛物线势垒的精确结果，对能量做热平均（Simpson 积分，在反应物能量 E = 0 处截断）；势垒很高时与解析式 (u/2)/sin(u/2) 一致。氘的振动频率和势垒虚频都按质量的 1/√2 缩放（忽略非谐性和其他原子的贡献），速率只给相对值（指前因子取 1）。Arrhenius 参数在 278–318 K 之间拟合。这个模型给出的同位素效应总是随温度升高而下降，它解释不了某些酶中温度无关的同位素效应：那需要让给体–受体距离随蛋白质运动涨落的模型（第 03 节）。',
          'One-dimensional Bell model: transmission is the exact result for a parabolic barrier, thermally averaged over energy (Simpson integration, truncated at the reactant energy E = 0); for a high barrier it agrees with the analytic (u/2)/sin(u/2). The deuterium vibrational frequency and barrier frequency both scale by 1/√2 with mass (ignoring anharmonicity and other atoms), and rates are relative (prefactor 1). Arrhenius parameters are fitted between 278 and 318 K. In this model the isotope effect always falls as temperature rises, so it cannot explain the temperature-independent isotope effects of some enzymes: that needs models in which the donor–acceptor distance fluctuates with protein motion (section 03).'),
      },
    },

